{"seq":1,"slug":"coarse-fine-rank","title":"推荐粗排与精排模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/ranking-diversity/coarse-fine-rank","wordCount":3415,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐粗排与精排模型\">推荐粗排与精排模型</h1><p>召回阶段的一万条候选，最终只有二十条能进入用户视野。中间这个从万到二十的收缩，由粗排与精排两层模型协作完成。两层都用模型打分、都做排序、都输出分数，看起来像是同一个东西跑了两次。实际上它们面对的约束完全不同：粗排要在毫秒级预算内给上万条候选打分（因此只能用小模型、少特征），精排只处理数百条候选但可以用大模型、上千个特征、甚至跨特征交互。理解这两层的分工与接口，是推荐排序工程的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分层排序的容量与预算\">核心概念：分层排序的容量与预算</h2><p>从召回池到最终列表，收缩是分段的：一万条候选经粗排缩到数百条，再由精排缩到数十条，最后经重排（多样性与约束）定型。每一段的候选规模与延迟预算成反比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[多路召回&lt;br/&gt;~10^4 条] --&gt; B[粗排 coarse rank&lt;br/&gt;~5ms 总预算]&#10;    B --&gt; C[精排 fine rank&lt;br/&gt;~50-100ms 总预算]&#10;    C --&gt; D[重排 rerank&lt;br/&gt;多样性 + 业务约束]&#10;    D --&gt; E[最终列表&lt;br/&gt;~20-50 条]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|候选规模决定模型容量| B1[小模型: 双塔/浅层&lt;br/&gt;特征数十个]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|候选规模允许| C1[大模型: DNN/多目标&lt;br/&gt;特征数百至上千]\">graph TD\n    A[多路召回&lt;br/&gt;~10^4 条] --&gt; B[粗排 coarse rank&lt;br/&gt;~5ms 总预算]\n    B --&gt; C[精排 fine rank&lt;br/&gt;~50-100ms 总预算]\n    C --&gt; D[重排 rerank&lt;br/&gt;多样性 + 业务约束]\n    D --&gt; E[最终列表&lt;br/&gt;~20-50 条]\n    B -.-&gt;|候选规模决定模型容量| B1[小模型: 双塔/浅层&lt;br/&gt;特征数十个]\n    C -.-&gt;|候选规模允许| C1[大模型: DNN/多目标&lt;br/&gt;特征数百至上千]</pre><p>分层的经济学可以用一句话概括：<strong>粗排的瓶颈是候选数量 × 单条打分成本，精排的瓶颈是特征读取成本与模型复杂度</strong>。一万条候选若每条要读 500 个特征，就是五百万次特征读取，在网络与存储层面都不可接受；因此粗排必然使用能批量预计算的特征（用户侧、商品侧各自可离线算好的）与轻量模型（如双塔内积、线性模型、浅层 MLP）。精排只需处理数百条候选，可以承担每条的完整特征拼装与深度模型推理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>粗排</th>\n<th>精排</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入候选数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟预算</td>\n<td>数毫秒</td>\n<td>数十至上百毫秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型复杂度</td>\n<td>低（双塔 / 浅层 / 线性）</td>\n<td>高（DNN / 多任务 / 序列模型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征数量</td>\n<td>数十级</td>\n<td>数百至上千级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征来源</td>\n<td>可离线预先计算的向量</td>\n<td>实时拼装，含交叉特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>保召回（不丢好候选）</td>\n<td>保精度（排准）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估指标</td>\n<td>粗排 Top-N 的召回率（相对精排结果）</td>\n<td>AUC / GAUC / 校准后偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败代价</td>\n<td>好候选永久丢失</td>\n<td>排序略差但候选仍在</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是分层的根本理由：<strong>粗排的错误不可挽回</strong>（被粗排丢掉的候选，精排看不到），精排的错误可容忍（候选还在池里，只是位次不理想）。因此粗排的优化目标不是「排得准」，而是「不丢」——它必须对精排的偏好有高召回率，而允许精度上的损失。这解释了为什么粗排常被实现为「精排模型的近似」：用蒸馏（distillation）把精排的排序能力压缩进一个轻量模型，学生模型的目标是复现教师模型的排序，而不是直接优化点击率（知识蒸馏的原始方法见 Hinton 等, <em>Distilling the Knowledge in a Neural Network</em>, NIPS 2014 Deep Learning Workshop, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531）。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"双塔作为粗排-为什么它天然适合\">双塔作为粗排：为什么它天然适合</h2><p>第二章第二篇讲的双塔结构在召回阶段产出候选，同一套结构也常被直接复用于粗排——但用法不同。召回时的双塔用 ANN 检索（要求近似与索引），粗排时的双塔只需<strong>对已确定的候选集合逐一算内积</strong>（无需索引，精确计算）。这个差别很关键：粗排不需要 ANN 的近似，因此没有召回率损失，代价只是无法扩展到全库（只在上万条候选上算，成本可控）。</p>\n<p>粗排用双塔的另一个好处是<strong>用户向量与商品向量可以复用召回阶段的计算结果</strong>——召回已经算过用户向量，粗排直接拿来用；商品向量在召回索引里已有。这意味着粗排的边际成本接近于零（一次稀疏-稠密矩阵乘法）。当粗排需要更强的表达能力时，常见做法是在双塔基础上加一层<strong>交叉网络</strong>（如对用户向量与商品向量做逐元素乘积后再过 MLP），这个结构比纯内积强、比完整 DNN 便宜，是粗排的常用折中。</p>\n<p>蒸馏到粗排的标准流程如下。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 训练精排模型（教师），得到完整特征下的精确打分&#10;2. 用教师对全量曝光样本打分，生成软标签（soft label）&#10;3. 训练粗排学生模型：&#10;   - 输入：仅可用离线预计算的特征（用户向量、商品向量、少量实时特征）&#10;   - 目标：最小化 student_score 与 teacher_score 的排序损失&#10;   - 损失：listwise 排序损失（如 LambdaRank）或按分数分桶的交叉熵&#10;4. 上线：学生模型对万级候选打分，取 Top-K 送精排\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 训练精排模型（教师），得到完整特征下的精确打分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 用教师对全量曝光样本打分，生成软标签（soft label）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 训练粗排学生模型：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 输入：仅可用离线预计算的特征（用户向量、商品向量、少量实时特征）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 目标：最小化 student_score 与 teacher_score 的排序损失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 损失：listwise 排序损失（如 LambdaRank）或按分数分桶的交叉熵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 上线：学生模型对万级候选打分，取 Top-K 送精排</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里第 3 步的目标函数选择值得展开：直接用回归（MSE 拟合教师分数）会让学生过度关注分数的绝对尺度（而教师分数的尺度本身无意义），更好的做法是用<strong>排序损失</strong>，只关心相对顺序（listwise 排序损失的经典形式见 Burges 等, <em>Learning to Rank using Gradient Descent</em>, ICML 2005, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/1102351.1102363）。这也是粗排评估指标选择「Top-N\">https://doi.org/10.1145/1102351.1102363）。这也是粗排评估指标选择「Top-N</a> 召回率」而非「AUC」的原因——AUC 关注全局排序，而粗排只需要保证头部不漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精排-多目标建模与分数融合\">精排：多目标建模与分数融合</h2><p>精排的核心难题是多目标。业务希望用户点击、转化、停留时长、复购都提升，但这些目标之间存在内在冲突：诱导点击的内容可能压低转化率；追求转化可能只推用户已经想买的商品（降低发现性）；拉长停留时长可能推荐与购买无关的娱乐化内容。单目标建模无法处理，因此精排普遍采用多任务学习。</p>\n<p>主流结构是<strong>共享底层 + 多输出头（multi-task learning, MTL）</strong>：底层网络学习用户与商品的通用表示，各任务各有自己的输出头。典型任务是 CTR（点击）、CVR（转化）、以及时长或评论类目标。共享底层的收益是参数复用与数据互助（点击数据远多于转化数据，共享底层让转化头受益于点击数据），风险是<strong>任务冲突（negative transfer）</strong>——某个任务的特征方向与其他任务相反时，共享底层会互相伤害。</p>\n<p>解决任务冲突的结构演进有清晰脉络，可以用下表对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬参数共享</td>\n<td>完全共享底层</td>\n<td>参数少、小任务受益</td>\n<td>任务冲突时互相伤害</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门控专家混合（MMoE）</td>\n<td>多个专家网络 + 每任务独立门控加权</td>\n<td>缓解冲突、可学习任务相关性</td>\n<td>门控可能退化为单专家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多级门控（PLE）</td>\n<td>分层剥离共享专家与任务专有专家</td>\n<td>进一步隔离冲突、工业效果稳定</td>\n<td>结构复杂、调参成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MMoE（Ma 等人, <em>Modeling Task Relationships in Multi-task Learning with Multi-gate Mixture-of-Experts</em>, KDD 2018, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3219819.3220007）与\">https://doi.org/10.1145/3219819.3220007）与</a> PLE（Tang 等人, <em>Progressive Layered Extraction</em>, RecSys 2020, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3383313.3412236）都是被业界广泛采纳的结构，二者的共同思想是「不要让所有任务强制共享同一个底层」——给每个任务保留私有容量，同时保留一部分共享容量。\">https://doi.org/10.1145/3383313.3412236）都是被业界广泛采纳的结构，二者的共同思想是「不要让所有任务强制共享同一个底层」——给每个任务保留私有容量，同时保留一部分共享容量。</a></p>\n<p>多目标建模完成后仍需一步<strong>分数融合</strong>：把多个任务概率合成一个排序分数。最直白的形式是加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\sum_{t \\in T} w_t \\cdot p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的预测概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。这个形式的问题是权重与概率尺度耦合——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分布随流量变化时，固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会失效。更稳的做法是<strong>按目标的重要度折算成可比的量纲</strong>：例如用「单次点击的期望价值」或「单次转化的期望毛利」作为折算系数，使各任务的分数进入同一个「价值」量纲再加和。这与第三章第三篇的业务约束（利润率保护）直接对接——折算系数里的毛利项正是商业目标进入排序模型的入口。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>CTR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>click</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>CVR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(d) = \\text{CTR}(d) \\cdot v_{\\text{click}} + \\text{CVR}(d) \\cdot \\text{GMV}(d) \\cdot m(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">click</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>click</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\text{click}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">click</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是点击的广告或时长价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的毛利率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GMV}(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是预估成交额。这个式子是「推荐目标即商业目标」的显式表达，也是为什么排序模型不能只看点击率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校准-分数尺度为什么必须修复\">校准：分数尺度为什么必须修复</h2><p>精排模型输出的概率常常<strong>不校准</strong>——预测 0.1 的点击率，线上实际可能是 0.06。原因有三：采样训练（负采样让样本分布偏离线上）、多任务共享底层带来的相互干扰、以及训练与线上特征分布不一致。不校准的分数在单模型内部排序时问题不大（单调性保持），但一旦需要跨模型比较、跨目标融合、或计算期望价值时就会系统性出错。</p>\n<p>校准的标准做法是<strong>保序回归（isotonic regression）<strong>或</strong> Platt 缩放</strong>：在验证集上拟合一个单调映射，把模型输出映射到校准后的概率。保序回归不假设函数形式，更灵活但数据需求大；Platt 缩放假设 S 型关系，参数少更稳（两种概率校准方法的系统比较见 Niculescu-Mizil &amp; Caruana, <em>Predicting Good Probabilities with Supervised Learning</em>, ICML 2005, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/1102351.1102430）。工程上通常按流量分片（分市场、分设备）分别拟合，因为不同分片的偏差结构不同。\">https://doi.org/10.1145/1102351.1102430）。工程上通常按流量分片（分市场、分设备）分别拟合，因为不同分片的偏差结构不同。</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>calib</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_{\\text{calib}} = \\sigma\\!\\left(a \\cdot \\log\\frac{p}{1-p} + b\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">calib</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是 Platt 缩放的形式，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a, b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 在验证集上拟合。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 S 型函数（logistic）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 必须定期（通常是每天或每周）用新数据重拟合，因为线上分布会随季节、活动、商品结构漂移。</p>\n<p>校准的必要性还有一个常被忽视的理由：<strong>它是降级策略的前提</strong>。第四章第三篇讨论的降级会把精排替换为粗排模型，如果两个模型的分数尺度不同，降级后列表的顺序会剧烈跳变（用户刷新一次看到完全不同的内容）。只有所有层的分数都被校准到同一个概率尺度，降级才能做到「顺序略有变化但不跳变」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练与服务一致性\">训练与服务一致性</h2><p>排序模型最隐蔽的一类缺陷是<strong>训练-服务偏差（training-serving skew）</strong>：同一特征在训练数据里与在线推理时的计算方式不同，导致模型在线表现远差于离线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差类型</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>预防手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>特征口径不一致</td>\n<td>离线用批量 SQL、在线用流式计算</td>\n<td>同一请求双写比对特征值</td>\n<td>特征平台统一计算逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间穿越</td>\n<td>训练样本用了未来才产生的特征</td>\n<td>检查特征的可用时间戳</td>\n<td>严格按事件时间做特征回填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失值处理不同</td>\n<td>离线填 0、在线填默认值</td>\n<td>统计缺失率与默认值分布</td>\n<td>显式定义缺失语义并统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本选择偏差</td>\n<td>只训练曝光过的样本</td>\n<td>对比候选分布与训练分布</td>\n<td>位置校正 + 全候选采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时特征延迟</td>\n<td>在线特征未及时更新返回旧值</td>\n<td>监控特征时间戳新鲜度</td>\n<td>设超时阈值 + 回退缓存值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行「时间穿越」是最致命的：如果训练样本里的「用户过去 24 小时的点击数」包含了标签时刻之后的数据，模型离线 AUC 会异常高（它偷看了未来），线上一落千丈。检测方式是人为把某组特征的可用时间截断，看离线指标是否大幅下滑——若下滑巨大，说明模型严重依赖未来信息。</p>\n<p>特征平台（feature store）的存在主要就是为了消除第一行与第二行：把特征计算逻辑集中定义一次，训练与服务都从同一个定义取数，并强制每个特征带「可用时间」元数据。若没有特征平台，至少要把「训练用特征生成代码」与「在线特征生成代码」放在同一个仓库并由同一批人维护，让一致性靠流程而非靠运气。（训练与服务之间的口径漂移属于 ML 系统里「隐藏技术债」的典型一类，见 Sculley 等, <em>Hidden Technical Debt in Machine Learning Systems</em>, NIPS 2015, <a href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2015/hash/86df7dcfd896fcaf2674f757a2463eba-Abstract.html。）\">https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2015/hash/86df7dcfd896fcaf2674f757a2463eba-Abstract.html。）</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>粗排与精排的差异在于候选规模与延迟预算：粗排万级候选用轻量模型与可预计算特征，精排百级候选用深度模型与完整交叉特征。</li>\n<li>粗排的错误不可挽回、精排的错误可容忍，因此粗排的目标是「不丢」而非「排准」，评估用 Top-N 召回率与蒸馏排序损失。</li>\n<li>精排普遍是多任务结构，MMoE / PLE 这类门控专家结构用于缓解任务冲突；多目标分数需融合为单一价值量纲，融合系数里应显式包含毛利等商业项。</li>\n<li>模型分数必须校准（保序回归 / Platt 缩放，分流量拟合、定期重拟合），否则跨模型比较、期望价值计算与降级都会系统性出错。</li>\n<li>训练-服务偏差有五类典型形态，其中「时间穿越」最致命；特征平台或统一的特征生成流程是结构性解法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关内容：候选池的产出与路标识契约见 <a href=\"../multi-recall/\">多路召回</a> 与 <a href=\"../multi-recall/vector-behavior-recall\">行为向量与 embedding 召回</a>；精排之后的列表级修正见 <a href=\"diversity-mmr\">多样性/去重与 MMR 重排</a>；毛利与合规如何进入排序见 <a href=\"business-constraints\">库存/合规/利润等业务约束插入</a>；降级时跨模型分数尺度一致性见 <a href=\"../coldstart-serving/rec-latency-serving\">推荐链路延迟与降级兜底</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐粗排与精排模型","id":"推荐粗排与精排模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分层排序的容量与预算","id":"核心概念-分层排序的容量与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"双塔作为粗排：为什么它天然适合","id":"双塔作为粗排-为什么它天然适合"},{"level":2,"text":"精排：多目标建模与分数融合","id":"精排-多目标建模与分数融合"},{"level":2,"text":"校准：分数尺度为什么必须修复","id":"校准-分数尺度为什么必须修复"},{"level":2,"text":"训练与服务一致性","id":"训练与服务一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"热门/新品/运营规则召回兜底","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/multi-recall/rule-hot-new-recall"},"next":{"title":"多样性/去重与 MMR 重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/ranking-diversity/diversity-mmr"}}